# Secrets for the Cloudflare Worker.
#
# Locally: copy this to .dev.vars (gitignored) and run `npm run cf:dev`.
# In production these are Worker Secrets, never a file:
#   npx wrangler secret put WPX_AUTH_TOKEN
#   npx wrangler secret put WPX_SITES
# The one-click deploy flow reads this file to know which secrets to prompt for.

# Shared secret clients must send as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
WPX_AUTH_TOKEN=""

# The WordPress sites this server manages, as a JSON array.
# appPassword comes from wp-admin > Users > Profile > Application Passwords.
WPX_SITES='[{"id":"main","url":"https://example.com","username":"admin","appPassword":"abcd EFGH ijkl MNOP qrst UVWX"}]'
